 ```yaml
 rules_version: 2
-rule_ids: [all]
+rule_ids:
+  - vertical_frame_itemspacing_uses_margin_bottom
+  - no_constraints_to_position_absolute_mapping
+  - figma_rules_conflict_uses_meta_marker
 ```
 
 ### Figma Spec 값 사용 규칙
